wrong[check 3\ncheck 4\ncheck 5\ncheck 6\nTrue\ncheck 2\ncheck 3\ncheck 4\nFalse]: `any` and `all` stop as soon as they know the answer, and the generator only calls `check` when they ask for the next value. So 5, 6 and the last 4 are never checked.
